{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52316","headline":"诗（幷序） 七十七 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 七十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饶你王侯[职]（识），饶君将相官。\n蛾眉珠玉佩，宝马金银鞍。\n锦绮嫌不着，猪羊死不飡。\n口中乞朴（项改「新」、张改作「扑」）断，眷属不相看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}